# Project Context: TuPhuongVoLo-ArtPipeline

This is an art pipeline automation project for the indie game "Tứ Phương Vô Lộ".

## Key Facts
- **Artist-first**: The primary user is a Vietnamese-speaking artist on Windows
- **Semi-automated**: Assists repetitive tasks, does NOT replace artistic decisions
- **Pipeline**: Illustrator SVG export → cleanup → Blender isometric render → editable outputs
- **SDD**: Every feature has spec.md → plan.md → tasks.md → quickstart.md

## Core Tools
- Adobe Illustrator (2D authoring) — JSX/ExtendScript for automation
- Blender (default 3D bridge) — bpy Python API, headless batch
- Maya (optional advanced) — mayapy, optional only
- Python 3.10+ (CLI glue) — pathlib, click, svgpathtools

## Critical Rules
- Windows-first (pathlib, .bat launchers, CRLF)
- Non-destructive (never overwrite source files)
- Naming convention: `tu_phuong_vo_lo_{name}_{variant}_{stage}_v{version}`
- Vietnamese artist documentation required
- Script-first — no mouse/click automation

## Read Before Coding
- `AGENTS.md` — full agent instructions
- `.specify/constitution.md` — project constitution
- `specs/NNN-feature/` — feature specs
